Lauro António (18 August 1942 – 3 February 2022) was a Portuguese movie director, producer and screenwriter. His 1980 movie "Morning Undersea" was entered into the 12th Moscow International Film Festival and won a special award. He was born in Lisbon, Portugal. His career began in 1975.
António died on 3 February 2022 in Lisbon at the age of 79.

