Merdeka 118 (also known as PNB 118, and formerly known as KL 118 and Warisan Merdeka Tower) is a 118-story, megatall skyscraper. It is currently under construction in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia. "Merdeka" means independent or free in Malaysian.
