Henry Thillberg (17 August 1930 – 6 February 2022) was a Swedish footballer. He played his entire career at Malmö FF as a midfielder from 1951 until 1962. Thillberg also played for the national team between 1953 until 1959, making 22 appearances and 8 goals. Thillberg was born in Malmö, Sweden.
Thillberg died from heart failure in Malmö on 6 February 2022, at the age of 91.

