= = = Gary Halpin = = =
Gary Halpin (14 February 1966 – 23 February 2021) was an Irish rugby union international player. He played as a prop for Wanderers F.C., Leinster, London Irish, Harlequins and the Irish national rugby union team. He was born in Dublin.
Halpin died on 23 February 2021 in Dublin, aged 55.

