= = = Bulantrisna Djelantik = = =
Ayu Bulantrisna Djelantik (8 September 1947 – 24 February 2021) was a Dutch-born Indonesian traditional Balinese dancer. She was an ENT specialist and a lecturer at the faculty of medicine at Padjadjaran University. 
Bulantrisna died on 24 February 2021 of pancreatic cancer at the age of 73.

