= = = Honeydew, California = = =
Honeydew (before as Honey Dew) is an unincorporated community in Humboldt County, California.
History.
The first post office at Honeydew opened in 1926. Honeydew, Petrolia and Capetown were originally stagecoach and mail stops in the 1800s.
Schools.
There are three schools in Honeydew: Honeydew Elementary School, Mattole Valley Triple Junction High School and Honeydew Charter School #159.

