Frank Francis Fasi (August 27, 1920 – February 3, 2010) was an American politician. He was the longest serving Mayor of Honolulu, Hawaii. He was mayor for 22 years. He also was a territorial senator and member of the Honolulu City Council.
Fasi died on February 2010 in Honolulu at the age 89.

= = = Kirk Caldwell = = =
Kirk William Caldwell (born September 4, 1952) is an American politician. He was the mayor of Honolulu, Hawaii from 2013 to 2021. He was a member of the Democratic Party. He unsuccessfully ran for Governor of Hawaii in 2022.

