Dana Robins Ivey (born August 12, 1941) is an American actress. In 1997, she won a Drama Desk Award. 
Her best known movie roles were in "The Color Purple" (1985), "Dirty Rotten Scoundrels" (1988), "The Addams Family" (1991), "" (1992), "Two Weeks Notice" (2002), "Rush Hour 3" (2007), and "The Help" (2011).

