Nyachae died on 1 February 2021 in Nairobi, aged 88.

= = = Sykkuno = = =
Thomas (born June 4,1992), better known by his online name Sykkuno is an American internet personality, Twitch streamer and YouTuber. He is known for his streams on the platform Twitch. He is known for playing with Disguised Toast, Corpse Husband, Valkyrae, Jacksepticeye and Pokimane.
Sykkuno's Twitch channel gained over 620,000 followers over a 30 days in November 2020, making him one of the fastest growing streamers on the platform.
