= = = Milvian bridge = = =
The Milvian (or Mulvian) Bridge is a bridge over the Tiber in northern Rome, Italy. The bridge goes back ot antiquity. Today, the bridge is also notable for the Battle of the Milvian Bridge, which happened in the year 312.

