The 23rd Street station of the IND Sixth Avenue Line shares the entrance with the 23rd Street station of the PATH, which is located in between this station's two side platforms. This station is for F and M trains.
Sometimes, E trains and other trains enter this station via 6th Avenue to World Trade Center or Jamaica Center or other stations .
After this station, the next stations will be 34th Street Herald Square and 14th Street .

