Coy is a town of the state of Arkansas in the United States of America.

= = = Hot Spring County, Arkansas = = =
Hot Spring County is a county of the U.S. state of Arkansas. As of the 2020 census, the population was 33,040. The county seat is Malvern. It was founded on November 2, 1829.

