Howard County is a county of the U.S. state of Arkansas. As of the 2020 census, 12,785 people lived there. The county seat is Nashville. It was formed on April 17, 1873 from parts of Hempstead, Sevier, Polk, and Pike counties.

= = = Rison, Arkansas = = =
Rison is a city in the US state of Arkansas.

