= = = Josep Lluís Núñez = = =
José Luis Núñez Clemente (7 September 1931 – 3 December 2018) was a Spanish businessman and politician. He was president of FC Barcelona between 1978 and 2000. Núñez used to own the "Núñez i Navarro" construction company and "Núñez i Navarro Hotels" chain. He was elected club president on 1 July 1978. His main objectives were to establish Barça as a world class sports club and to give the club financial stability. He was born in Guriezo, Cantabria.
In July 2011, Núñez was sentenced to six years in jail following conviction on a series of fraud charges. The sentence was appealed and Núñez was allowed bail. In November 2014, he entered in jail.
Núñez died on 3 December 2018 in Barcelona at the age of 87.

= = = Michele Carey = = =
Michele Carey (born Michele Lee Henson, February 26, 1943 – November 21, 2018) was an American actress. She was known for her role as Josephine "Joey" MacDonald in the 1966 movie "El Dorado". She appeared in movies in the 1960s and 1970s. She was born in Annapolis, Maryland. She also starred in "Live a Little, Love a Little" (1968), "The Sweet Ride" (1968), and "Dirty Dingus Magee" (1970).
