Aaron Chatman (born 11 May 1987) is an athlete from Australia. He is disabled. He competed in the 2008 Summer Paralympics in Beijing, China and won a silver medal in the men's High jump—F44/46 and a bronze medal in the men's 4 x 100 metre relay—T42-46 race. Irina Dvoskina was his coach.

= = = Darren Collins = = =
Darren Collins is a disabled athlete from Australia. He won two bronze medals at the 1992 Summer Paralympics in the Men's 200 m B1 race and the Men's 400 m B1 race.

