Han Myeong-hoe (���, 1415 - 1487) was a Korean Joseon Dynasty politician, writer, and soldier. He was the fther-in-law of King Yejong of Joseon (the 8th King of Joseon Dynasty) and Seongjong of Joseon (9th King of Joseon Dynasty and nephew of Yejong of Joseon).
